1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site-main top-main","id":"main","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"hero","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"mycmux 紹介とガイド"}],["$","h1",null,{"children":[["$","span","0",{"className":"hero-phrase","children":"エージェントの"}],["$","span","1",{"className":"hero-phrase","children":"作業を、"}],["$","span","2",{"className":"hero-phrase","children":"ひとつの画面で"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"hero-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"mycmux は、Claude Code や Codex を並べて動かすターミナルワークスペースです。進み具合を横目で見ながら、続きを別のエージェントへ渡せます。"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"hero-actions","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<a href=\"/start#first-ten\">最初の 10 分へ</a><a href=\"/guide\">使い方を探す</a>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"hero-screen","children":["$","figure",null,{"className":"shot shot-wide","data-shot":"02_workspace-overview","children":[["$","picture",null,{"children":"$e"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"fig-no","children":"図 1"}],[["$","span",null,{"className":"hero-legend-wide","children":"左にワークスペース一覧、右に Claude Code、shell、Codex が並んでいます。各ペインの下には入力欄があります。"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"hero-legend-narrow","children":"狭い幅でも、一覧の右に Claude Code、shell、Codex が横に並びます。"}]],["$","a",null,{"className":"shot-full","href":"/shots/02_workspace-overview.png","children":"画像を原寸で開く"}]]}]]}]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"top-section top-overview","id":"overview","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"section-heading","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-index","children":"まず 1 枚で"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"全体像"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"overview-text","children":[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>端末の中では、Claude Code、Codex、claude-codex、Grok Build、シェルが動きます。Web ペインとダッシュボードも、同じウィンドウの中です。</p><p>左のサイドバーでワークスペースを選び、右のタブに端末や Web ペインを置きます。タブ内のペインを切り替えても、裏の作業は動き続けます。</p><p>各ペインの下には、長い指示を書ける入力欄があります。</p><p>ダッシュボードへ切り替えると、別のワークスペースの会話もまとめて見られます。</p><p>委譲 CLI（公開リポジトリのスクリプト）と hook は、ローカルソケットを通して状態をやり取りします。</p>"}}]]}],[["$","figure","0",{"className":"fig","data-fig":"F2","children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"fig-wide","viewBox":"0 0 1120 560","width":"100%","role":"img","aria-label":"mycmux ウィンドウと、PTY 上の CLI、Web サービス、委譲 CLI と hook が通るローカルソケットの関係図","data-vw":1120,"data-fs":23,"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","children":[["$","title",null,{"children":"mycmux ウィンドウと、PTY 上の CLI、Web サービス、委譲 CLI と hook が通るローカルソケットの関係図"}],["$","defs",null,{"children":[["$","marker",null,{"id":"F2-wide-arrow","viewBox":"0 0 10 10","refX":"9","refY":"5","markerWidth":"8","markerHeight":"8","orient":"auto-start-reverse","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M0 0L10 5L0 10z","className":"arrowhead"}]}],["$","marker",null,{"id":"F2-wide-arrow-accent","viewBox":"0 0 10 10","refX":"9","refY":"5","markerWidth":"8","markerHeight":"8","orient":"auto-start-reverse","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M0 0L10 5L0 10z","className":"arrowhead accent"}]}]]}],[["$","g","0",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M240 95.2L350 95","className":"edge","markerEnd":"url(#F2-wide-arrow)"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","g","1",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M880 275L770 275","className":"edge","markerEnd":"url(#F2-wide-arrow)"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","g","2",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M560 410L560 340","className":"edge dashed","markerEnd":"url(#F2-wide-arrow)"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","g","3",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M240 450L330 450","className":"edge dashed","markerEnd":"url(#F2-wide-arrow)"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","g","4",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M880 450L790 450","className":"edge dashed","markerEnd":"url(#F2-wide-arrow)"}],"$undefined"]}]],[["$","g","cli",{"className":"node n-group","data-w":240,"data-id":"cli","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":0,"y":0,"width":240,"height":340,"rx":8}],["$","text",null,{"x":12,"textAnchor":"start","fontSize":23,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":12,"y":31.55,"className":"title","children":"PTY 上の CLI"}]]}]]